# Stable spec ID: iba-paloma. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(tequila, 100% agave) 50 ml
(lime: juice) 5 ml
(salt) 1 pinch
(grapefruit soda) 100 ml

::equipment
(highball glass)

::instructions
(tequila) + (lime: juice) <pour, into (highball glass)>
(salt) <add>
<fill, with ice>
(grapefruit soda) <add> <stir, gently>
<garnish, with a lime slice>

